### 1. Buat artikel
POST http://localhost:3001/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "testing crud persistence",
  "summary": "tes doangggggggggg",
  "content": "netanyahu cepet mati tolong PERISH JUDAH",
  "image": ""
}

### 2. Daftar semua artikel
GET http://localhost:3001/articles

### 3. Ambil satu artikel (ganti ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/articles/c737eb42-f756-4774-a9e9-237baffa240f

### 4. Ubah artikel (ganti ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/articles/c737eb42-f756-4774-a9e9-237baffa240f
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "tes patch http request"
}

### 5. Hapus artikel (ganti ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/articles/c737eb42-f756-4774-a9e9-237baffa240f

### 6. Uji validasi (harus 400)
POST http://localhost:3001/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "a",
  "content": "pendek"
}

### 7. Uji NotFound (harus 404)
GET http://localhost:3001/articles/tidak-ada

### 8. Uji Conflict (jalankan POST dengan judul yang sama dua kali)
POST http://localhost:3001/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "tes migrasi prisma edittttt",
  "content": "artikel untuk menguji judul duplikat pada backend KSBF."
}
